+  // Ottsel H3: when compiling for ARM64, GOAL asm register names refer to the
+  // ARM64 kernel register mapping. The GOAL kernel asm functions are written
+  // with x86 names; the ARM64 mapping mirrors the roles those regs play
+  // (see docs/evidence/H1/arm64-abi.md):
+  //   rax -> x0 (return/temp)
+  //   rbx,rbp,r10,r11,r12 -> x19,x29,x23,x24,x25 (saved)
